\">\n                <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#0fbc5c\"></stop><stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#0cba65\"></stop>\n               </linearGradient>\n               <path d=\"M322 333.7v60c5.5.6 11.2 1 17.2 1s11.9-.3 17.5-.9v-59.7c-6.3 1.1-12.3 1.5-17.5 1.5-5.9 0-11.6-.7-17.2-1.9z\" opacity=\".5\" fill=\"url(#:R39166tbdm:-J)\"></path>\n              </g>\n             </g>\n            </svg>\n            <span>Add as preferred on Google</span>\n           </button> \n          </a>\n         </div>\n        </div>\n       </div>\n       <div class=\"Byline-styles__ContributorsContainerStyled-sc-66f6383-1 boAITb\">\n        <span data-testid=\"byline-contributors\" class=\"Byline-styles__ContributorsWrapperStyled-sc-66f6383-11 jAxtgX\"> \n         <div data-testid=\"byline-contributors-contributor-0\" class=\"Byline-styles__ContributorWrapperStyled-sc-66f6383-5 bnLRKM\">\n          <div class=\"Byline-styles__TextContentWrapperStyled-sc-66f6383-7 jifHas\">\n           <span class=\"Byline-styles__AuthorNameStyled-sc-66f6383-8 YMqIp\">Thomas Germain</span>\n          </div>\n         </div> \n        </span>\n       </div>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"image-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 dYcznU\">\n    <figure class=\"ieGDnl\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 gvGaxq\">\n      <div data-testid=\"hero-image\" class=\"Image-styles__ImageCardStyled-sc-8c99a12b-1 jJQpIc\">\n       <img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260723-115353-11d20ce153-web-3.15.1-1/grey-placeholder.png\" class=\"Image-styles__ImageStyled-sc-8c99a12b-0 kpUtIW hide-when-no-script\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 50vw, (min-width: 1008px) 66vw, 96vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/160xn/p0p1bz4l.jpg.webp 160w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/240xn/p0p1bz4l.jpg.webp 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/320xn/p0p1bz4l.jpg.webp 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/480xn/p0p1bz4l.jpg.webp 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/640xn/p0p1bz4l.jpg.webp 640w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/800xn/p0p1bz4l.jpg.webp 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/1024xn/p0p1bz4l.jpg.webp 1024w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/1376xn/p0p1bz4l.jpg.webp 1376w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/1920xn/p0p1bz4l.jpg.webp 1920w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/480xn/p0p1bz4l.jpg.webp\" loading=\"eager\" alt=\"BBC/ Serenity Strull/ Getty Images Hand holding a smartphone with big dots on the edges of the screen\" class=\"Image-styles__ImageStyled-sc-8c99a12b-0 cVsHni\"><span class=\"Image-styles__CreditStyled-sc-8c99a12b-2 dVFjVB\">BBC/ Serenity Strull/ Getty Images</span>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 tlbDj\">\n      <figcaption class=\"Caption-styles__CaptionStyled-sc-70433723-0 fLsOPx\">(Credit: BBC/ Serenity Strull/ Getty Images)</figcaption>\n     </div>\n    </figure>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\"><b id=\"a-buried-iphone-setting-is-turning-heads-and-saving-stomachs.-but-does-relief-just-mean-more-time-staring-at-your-screen?\" class=\"TextFragment-styles__TextFragmentStyled-sc-99e7c69b-0 jlzOpL\">A buried iPhone setting is turning heads and saving stomachs. But does relief just mean more time staring at your screen?</b></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\">I try not to look at other people's phones, but you get unintentional glances jammed in the crowds on the New York subway, bodies lurching around as the train blasts through tunnels. Lately I've noticed something strange. I keep seeing people with dots dancing across their screens.</p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\">The more I saw it, the more I needed to know. It turns out all these people have something in common: they get motion sickness.</p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\">This choreographed dot ballet is a lesser-known iPhone setting called \"<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://support.apple.com/guide/iphone/iphone-comfortably-riding-a-vehicle-iph55564cb22/ios\" class=\"LinkUrl-styles__LinkUrlStyled-sc-f4e3b82f-0 eGAhOs\">Vehicle Motion Cues</a>\" that's supposed to help. It puts animated dots on the edges of your screen, which move in sync with the motion of the vehicle you're in, thanks to the phone's accelerometer.</p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\">Reviews are mixed, but over the past few months, some people have gone wild for it. One man I met on the subway told me he loves the feature so much he keeps it on 24 hours a day, even when he's not moving – though he declined to share his name with the strange journalist asking questions on his commute.</p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\">The dots could be an antidote if you're cursed with a history of queasy car rides. I was born with an iron stomach, so I'm afraid I can't relate. But I think there's something more interesting happening. Bit by bit, our devices are adapting to infiltrate more of our lives.</p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"subheadline-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 fMCMex\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 tlbDj\">\n      <h2 class=\"Headline-styles__HeadlineStyled-sc-6b3bb442-0 knYLIy\"><span id=\"a-phone-for-what-ails-you\" class=\"TextFragment-styles__TextFragmentStyled-sc-99e7c69b-0 fa-DACi\"><b id=\"a-phone-for-what-ails-you\" class=\"TextFragment-styles__TextFragmentStyled-sc-99e7c69b-0 jlzOpL\">A phone for what ails you</b></span></h2>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\">Here's some trivia I learned talking to doctors for this story: it seems like most of the people who study motion sickness get motion sickness.</p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\">\"When I go on a cruise, I'm in my bunk for like 72 to 96 hours. I can't eat, I can't get up,\" says Tom Stoffregen, professor emeritus at the University of Minnesota, US, who's been studying motion sickness since the 1980s.</p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\">Experts disagree about what causes motion sickness. The classic explanation is \"<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/15677267/\" class=\"LinkUrl-styles__LinkUrlStyled-sc-f4e3b82f-0 eGAhOs\">sensory conflict theory</a>\": your inner ear detects movement, but other senses (like your sight) see a bunch of fixed objects that seem like they aren't going anywhere.</p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\">Stoffregen doesn't buy it. Instead, he says the issue is your muscles and other bodily systems are constantly guessing where you're about to move to <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/10052575/\" class=\"LinkUrl-styles__LinkUrlStyled-sc-f4e3b82f-0 eGAhOs\">control your posture</a>, and you get discombobulated when the prediction fails. That might explain why passengers get sick but drivers usually don't, because they're controlling the car.</p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\">Either way, the confusion makes some of us nauseous, says Kristen Steenerson, a clinical associate professor at Stanford University, US, who studies the vestibular system, which controls balance.</p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\">\"That deviation is what makes people feel dizzy, or disoriented,\" says Steenerson. \"And probably due to some interesting evolutionary coincidences, that elicits a lot of nausea.\" We may have evolved to assume we've eaten something toxic when we feel disoriented, she says, so your body thinks it a good time to vomit.</p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\">If you can give your body signals that demonstrate how you're moving through space, it can mitigate motion sickness, Steenerson says. The iPhone's dots seem to follow the same logic. \"They give you a sense of how you are moving in space,\" she says.</p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\">\"There is some research that has looked into visual feedback and found it can be very helpful,\" says Steenerson. For example, you can buy phenomenally goofy anti-nausea glasses that are filled with liquid that sloshes around in a similar fashion, and <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S2666691X2300060X\" class=\"LinkUrl-styles__LinkUrlStyled-sc-f4e3b82f-0 eGAhOs\">there's evidence they work</a>. If you've never seen them, I am delighted to present you with the photo below.</p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"image-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 kugUwP\">\n    <figure class=\"ieGDnl\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 tlbDj\">\n      <div data-testid=\"image\" class=\"Image-styles__ImageCardStyled-sc-8c99a12b-1 bOmCce\">\n       <img src=\"https://static.files.bbci.co.uk/bbcdotcom/web/20260723-115353-11d20ce153-web-3.15.1-1/grey-placeholder.png\" class=\"Image-styles__ImageStyled-sc-8c99a12b-0 kpUtIW hide-when-no-script\" aria-label=\"image unavailable\"><img sizes=\"(min-width: 1280px) 50vw, (min-width: 1008px) 66vw, 96vw\" srcset=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/160xn/p0p198tb.png.webp 160w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/240xn/p0p198tb.png.webp 240w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/320xn/p0p198tb.png.webp 320w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/480xn/p0p198tb.png.webp 480w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/640xn/p0p198tb.png.webp 640w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/800xn/p0p198tb.png.webp 800w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/1024xn/p0p198tb.png.webp 1024w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/1376xn/p0p198tb.png.webp 1376w, https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/1920xn/p0p198tb.png.webp 1920w\" src=\"https://ichef.bbci.co.uk/images/ic/480xn/p0p198tb.png.webp\" loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"Citroën Anti-motion sickness glasses can help with nausea, but at what cost? (Credit: Citroën)\" class=\"Image-styles__ImageStyled-sc-8c99a12b-0 cVsHni\"><span class=\"Image-styles__CreditStyled-sc-8c99a12b-2 dVFjVB\">Citroën</span>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 tlbDj\">\n      <figcaption class=\"Caption-styles__CaptionStyled-sc-70433723-0 fLsOPx\">Anti-motion sickness glasses can help with nausea, but at what cost? (Credit: Citroën)</figcaption>\n     </div>\n    </figure>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\">Steenerson says the dots help a little with her own motion sickness. \"Everyone thinks there's something wrong with my screen. These dots are so cool,\" she says.</p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\">To turn it on, open your iPhone Settings &gt; Accessibility &gt; Motion &gt; Vehicle Motion Cues. You can leave the dots on perpetually or have them turn on automatically when your phone detects motion. Android apps can replicate the setting, and there are rumours a similar feature is coming to Pixel phones.</p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\">You can also change the size and colour. I've been walking around with big purple dots on my screen that make for great conversation starters.</p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\">Some motion sickness victims told me vehicle motion cues didn't help, but some people call them a miracle.</p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\">Zandie Brockett, a curator from New York City, swears by them. \"It's been a game changer,\" she says, enough to turn her into an iPhone-dots evangelist. \"I'm not screaming about them from the rooftops. But I recommend them anytime someone tells me they get car sick.\"</p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\">I heard the same from my old boss, Rory Carroll. His car sickness is particularly ironic, as he spends a lot of time in the passenger's seat for work: he's editor-in-chief of <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://alloymag.com/\" class=\"LinkUrl-styles__LinkUrlStyled-sc-f4e3b82f-0 eGAhOs\">Alloy</a>, a car enthusiast news publication. \"It's a bit of an occupational hazard,\" Caroll says. \"It's solving a very specific problem that I've had my whole life. The dots really work.\"</p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\">Fans of the iPhone dots kept telling me the same observation. They are only useful when you get motion sick <i id=\"because-you're-looking-at-your-phone\" class=\"TextFragment-styles__TextFragmentStyled-sc-99e7c69b-0 kAUhPg\">because you're looking at your phone</i>.</p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\">In other words, your reward is yet another opportunity to look at your screen. Which isn't a reward at all, perhaps, when so many people worry about screen time. \"It is a bit of a bummer to have one less reason not to look at Instagram,\" says Carroll.</p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\"><b id=\"more-like-this:\" class=\"TextFragment-styles__TextFragmentStyled-sc-99e7c69b-0 jlzOpL\">More like this:</b></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\">•&nbsp;<a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.bbc.com/future/article/20260630-is-your-tech-giving-you-phone-body\" class=\"LinkUrl-styles__LinkUrlStyled-sc-f4e3b82f-0 eGAhOs\">Is your tech giving you phone body?</a></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"\" class=\"LinkUrl-styles__LinkUrlStyled-sc-f4e3b82f-0 eGAhOs\"></a>•&nbsp;<a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.bbc.com/future/article/20260407-the-blue-light-from-your-phone-isnt-ruining-your-sleep\" class=\"LinkUrl-styles__LinkUrlStyled-sc-f4e3b82f-0 eGAhOs\">Your phone's blue light isn't ruining your sleep</a></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\"><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"\" class=\"LinkUrl-styles__LinkUrlStyled-sc-f4e3b82f-0 eGAhOs\"></a>•&nbsp;<a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.bbc.com/future/article/20260721-ai-has-ruined-cute-animal-videos\" class=\"LinkUrl-styles__LinkUrlStyled-sc-f4e3b82f-0 eGAhOs\">The saddest question on the internet: Is that cat real?</a></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\">Phones consume modern life, and new developments are letting them creep into the few remaining times we can't use them. Ever-growing battery life means screens stay on for longer. Elon Musk and his competitors have blanketed the sky with satellites that beam Wi-Fi and phone service to once disconnected areas.</p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\">There's even a rumour that Apple is working <a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://www.bbc.com/future/article/20260624-why-tech-companies-want-to-take-away-your-screen\" class=\"LinkUrl-styles__LinkUrlStyled-sc-f4e3b82f-0 eGAhOs\">AirPods with cameras in them</a>, not for taking photos, but to serve as eyes for new AI voice tools you can use screen-free. It may allow for new computing opportunities in those rare phoneless moments, like when you're walking down the street.</p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\">If looking at screens makes you car sick, you might want to try the iPhone dots. Or – stop me if this sounds crazy – you could just put your phone down and enjoy the ride.</p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\">--</p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\"><i id=\"for-more-technology-news-and-insights,-sign-up-to-our\" class=\"TextFragment-styles__TextFragmentStyled-sc-99e7c69b-0 kAUhPg\">For more technology news and insights, sign up to our </i><a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://cloud.email.bbc.com/techdecoded-newsletter-signup\" class=\"LinkUrl-styles__LinkUrlStyled-sc-f4e3b82f-0 eGAhOs\"><i id=\"tech-decoded\" class=\"TextFragment-styles__TextFragmentStyled-sc-99e7c69b-0 kAUhPg\">Tech Decoded</i></a><i id=\"newsletter,-while\" class=\"TextFragment-styles__TextFragmentStyled-sc-99e7c69b-0 kAUhPg\"> newsletter, while </i><a target=\"_self\" href=\"https://cloud.email.bbc.com/SignUp10_08?&amp;at_bbc_team=studios&amp;at_medium=Onsite&amp;at_objective=acquisition&amp;at_ptr_name=bbc.com&amp;at_link_origin=featuresarticle&amp;at_campaign=essentiallist&amp;at_campaign_type=owned\" class=\"LinkUrl-styles__LinkUrlStyled-sc-f4e3b82f-0 eGAhOs\"><i id=\"the-essential-list\" class=\"TextFragment-styles__TextFragmentStyled-sc-99e7c69b-0 kAUhPg\">The Essential List</i></a><i id=\"delivers-a-handpicked-selection-of-features-and-insights-to-your-inbox-twice-a-week.\" class=\"TextFragment-styles__TextFragmentStyled-sc-99e7c69b-0 kAUhPg\"> delivers a handpicked selection of features and insights to your inbox twice a week.</i></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div>\n   <div data-component=\"text-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 cPmzSx\">\n    <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n     <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 bnCeGm\">\n      <p class=\"Paragraph-styles__ParagraphStyled-sc-ffb5f5ba-0 fqhmpl\"><i id=\"for-more-science,-technology,-environment-and-health-stories-from-the-bbc,-follow-us-on\" class=\"TextFragment-styles__TextFragmentStyled-sc-99e7c69b-0 kAUhPg\">For more science, technology, environment and health stories from the BBC, follow us on </i><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.facebook.com/BBCFuture/\" class=\"LinkUrl-styles__LinkUrlStyled-sc-f4e3b82f-0 eGAhOs\"><i id=\"facebook\" class=\"TextFragment-styles__TextFragmentStyled-sc-99e7c69b-0 kAUhPg\">Facebook</i></a><i id=\"and\" class=\"TextFragment-styles__TextFragmentStyled-sc-99e7c69b-0 kAUhPg\"> and </i><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.instagram.com/bbcfuture_official/\" class=\"LinkUrl-styles__LinkUrlStyled-sc-f4e3b82f-0 eGAhOs\"><i id=\"instagram\" class=\"TextFragment-styles__TextFragmentStyled-sc-99e7c69b-0 kAUhPg\">Instagram</i></a><i id=\".\" class=\"TextFragment-styles__TextFragmentStyled-sc-99e7c69b-0 kAUhPg\">.</i></p>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n  <div data-component=\"tag-list-block\" class=\"Container-styles__ContainerStyled-sc-8b855a6c-0 kugUwP\">\n   <div class=\"hRsXiV\">\n    <div class=\"GridItem-styles__GridItemStyled-sc-6cc20e4a-0 hUaOpu\">\n     <div class=\"TagList-styles__TagListStyled-sc-85057056-0 khgklL\">\n      <div data-testid=\"anchor-inner-wrapper\">\n       <a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/future/tags/technology\" data-testid=\"internal-link\" class=\"Tag-styles__TagLink-sc-4548ff26-0 cATFfa\">Technology</a>\n      </div>\n      <div data-testid=\"anchor-inner-wrapper\">\n       <a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/future/tags/health\" data-testid=\"internal-link\" class=\"Tag-styles__TagLink-sc-4548ff26-0 cATFfa\">Health</a>\n      </div>\n      <div data-testid=\"anchor-inner-wrapper\">\n       <a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/future/tags/keeping-tabs\" data-testid=\"internal-link\" class=\"Tag-styles__TagLink-sc-4548ff26-0 cATFfa\">Keeping Tabs</a>\n      </div>\n      <div data-testid=\"anchor-inner-wrapper\">\n       <a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/future/tags/thomas-germain\" data-testid=\"internal-link\" class=\"Tag-styles__TagLink-sc-4548ff26-0 cATFfa\">Thomas Germain</a>\n      </div>\n      <div data-testid=\"anchor-inner-wrapper\">\n       <a href=\"https://www.bbc.com/future/tags/features\" data-testid=\"internal-link\" class=\"Tag-styles__TagLink-sc-4548ff26-0 cATFfa\">Features</a>\n      </div>\n     </div>\n    </div>\n   </div>\n  </div>\n </body>\n</html>",
  "aiSummary": "iPhone 隐藏的 Vehicle Motion Cues 使用移动的点来缓解晕动病，但可能增加屏幕使用时间。",
  "oneSentenceSummary": "iPhone 隐藏的 Vehicle Motion Cues 使用移动的点来缓解晕动病，但可能增加屏幕使用时间。",
  "summary": "文章探讨了 iPhone 的 Vehicle Motion Cues 辅助功能，该功能在屏幕边缘显示随车辆运动同步移动的动画点，以缓解晕动病。它解释了晕动病的感官冲突和姿势控制理论，引用了 Tom Stoffregen 和 Kristen Steenerson 等专家的观点，指出视觉反馈有助于协调感官输入。用户轶事显示结果不一：有人称该功能是游戏规则的改变者，也有人认为它无效。文章还指出减轻晕动病可能导致更多屏幕使用时间的讽刺，引用了担心失去放下手机理由的用户的话。最后，文章将该功能呈现为一种选择，同时提醒读者仅仅放下手机可能是最简单的补救办法。",
